menu "SDGOODS Launcher (multi-app dynamic slots)"

    config SDGOODS_APP_SLOTS
        int "Number of app slots"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          How many OTA app slots the launcher manages at runtime.
          The partition table (partitions.csv) must contain at least this
          many contiguous ota_N partitions; the launcher caps itself to the
          smaller of this value and the actual number of ota partitions found.
          See docs/MULTI_APP_DYNAMIC_SLOTS.md (decision #1: 4 slots x 3MB).

    config SDGOODS_APP_SLOT_BYTES
        int "App slot size in bytes"
        default 3145728
        range 65536 4194304
        help
          Must match the size of each ota_N partition in partitions.csv
          (default 3MB). App images over 2.9MB are rejected at upload time
          (decision #2); this value is used for sanity bounds only.

endmenu
